### 4. State Graph & Observability (LangGraph & LangSmith)

#### [NEW] [src/graph.py](file:///d:/SnowWiki/src/graph.py)
- `SnowWikiState(TypedDict)`: Graph state schema tracking `query`, `branch`, `memory`, `intent`, `confidence`, `answer`, `retrieved_chunks`, `grounding_sources`, etc.
- Graph Nodes:
  - `classify_intent`: Runs intent classification chain.
  - `route`: Conditional edge directing to `greeting`, `out_of_scope`, or `servicenow`.
  - `greeting`: Handles chit-chat / greetings via small model.
  - `out_of_scope`: Returns standardized out-of-scope guidance without full RAG.
  - `servicenow`: Executes local ChromaDB vector retrieval, RAG answer generation, and web fallback.
- Compile into `snowwiki_app` runnable.

#### [NEW] [src/tracing.py](file:///d:/SnowWiki/src/tracing.py)
